    <body>
      <trans-unit id="1" resname="automatic_breaks.title"><source>automatic_breaks.title</source><target>Sjálvvirkandi steðgir</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="2" resname="automatic_breaks.rule"><source>automatic_breaks.rule</source><target>Regla</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="3" resname="automatic_breaks.threshold"><source>automatic_breaks.threshold</source><target>Meira enn (minuttir)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="4" resname="automatic_breaks.total"><source>automatic_breaks.total</source><target>Steðgur tilsamans (minuttir)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="5" resname="automatic_breaks.maximum"><source>automatic_breaks.maximum</source><target>Mesta arbeiðstíð (minuttir; 0 = óvirkið)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="6" resname="automatic_breaks.reset"><source>automatic_breaks.reset</source><target>Nýggjur arbeiðspartur eftir steðg (minuttir)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="7" resname="automatic_breaks.workday"><source>automatic_breaks.workday</source><target>Nýggjur arbeiðsdagur eftir steðg (minuttir)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="8" resname="automatic_breaks.excluded"><source>automatic_breaks.excluded</source><target>Undantiknir bólkar</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="9" resname="automatic_breaks.editable"><source>automatic_breaks.editable</source><target>Lidnar skrásetingar kunnu broytast. Frádráttir, sum eru strikaðir, verða ikki lagdir afturat aftur.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="10" resname="automatic_breaks.legal"><source>automatic_breaks.legal</source><target>Útroknaðir frádráttir prógva ikki, at steðgur er hildin.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="11" resname="automatic_breaks.added"><source>automatic_breaks.added</source><target>Upprunaligur sjálvvirkandi frádráttur (minuttir)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="12" resname="automatic_breaks.review"><source>automatic_breaks.review</source><target>Kanna hesa skráseting manuelt.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="13" resname="automatic_breaks.invalid"><source>automatic_breaks.invalid</source><target>Kanna raðfylgjuna á mørkum, samlaðar steðgir og longdina á steðgunum.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="14" resname="automatic_breaks.rule_count"><source>automatic_breaks.rule_count</source><target>Tal av reglum (1–10)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="15" resname="automatic_breaks.help.enabled"><source>automatic_breaks.help.enabled</source><target>Ger frádrátt við fyrstu avslutning. Virknar tímateljingar verða ikki broyttar. Seinni rættingar eru møguligar.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="16" resname="automatic_breaks.help.rule_count"><source>automatic_breaks.help.rule_count</source><target>Vel 1–10 reglur. At goyma eitt lægri tal strikar tær seinastu reglurnar.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="17" resname="automatic_breaks.help.threshold"><source>automatic_breaks.help.threshold</source><target>Skrásettir minuttir í blokkinum áðrenn frádrátt. Markið skal verða farið upp um og vera hægri enn tað fyrra. Steðgir telja ikki sum arbeiði.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="18" resname="automatic_breaks.help.total"><source>automatic_breaks.help.total</source><target>Samlaður steðgur, ikki eyka frádráttur. Verandi steðgir verða taldir við. Hægsta reglan kemur í staðin fyri tær fyrru. Samløgan má ikki minka.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="19" resname="automatic_breaks.help.maximum"><source>automatic_breaks.help.maximum</source><target>Mesta tal av nettominuttum í øllum blokkum á arbeiðsdegnum. Avlop verður drigið frá seinastu lidnu skráseting. 0 sløkkir markið.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="20" resname="automatic_breaks.help.reset"><source>automatic_breaks.help.reset</source><target>Minsti útskrásetti steðgur, sum byrjar blokkreglurnar av nýggjum. 0 sløkkir endurbyrjan innan arbeiðsdagin. Dagsmarkið er óheft.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="21" resname="automatic_breaks.help.workday"><source>automatic_breaks.help.workday</source><target>Steðgur, sum byrjar nýggjan arbeiðsdag og nullstillar báðar teljarar. Vanligt: 660 minuttir. Midnátt einsamøll nullstillar einki.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="22" resname="automatic_breaks.help.excluded"><source>automatic_breaks.help.excluded</source><target>Frítekur nú alla persónin við limaskapi í einum valdum toymi, eisini við fleiri toymum. Skrásetingar hava einki arbeiðstoymi.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="23" resname="automatic_breaks.notice.rule"><source>automatic_breaks.notice.rule</source><target xml:space="preserve">Tú hevur skrásett meira enn %threshold% av samanhangandi arbeiði. Tí varð %added% steðgur sjálvvirkandi lagdur afturat skrásetingini.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="24" resname="automatic_breaks.notice.maximum"><source>automatic_breaks.notice.maximum</source><target xml:space="preserve">Tú hevur farið upp um mesta arbeiðstíðina á %threshold% fyri hvønn arbeiðsdag. Tí varð %added% steðgur sjálvvirkandi lagdur afturat skrásetingini.</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="25" resname="automatic_breaks.duration.separator"><source>automatic_breaks.duration.separator</source><target xml:space="preserve"> og </target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="26" resname="automatic_breaks.duration.hours"><source>automatic_breaks.duration.hours</source><target xml:space="preserve">{count, plural, one {# tími} other {# tímar}}</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="27" resname="automatic_breaks.duration.minutes"><source>automatic_breaks.duration.minutes</source><target xml:space="preserve">{count, plural, one {# minuttur} other {# minuttir}}</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="28" resname="automatic_breaks.duration.seconds"><source>automatic_breaks.duration.seconds</source><target xml:space="preserve">{count, plural, one {# sekund} other {# sekund}}</target></trans-unit>
    </body>
